{"ticker":"ORLY","updated":"2026-11-07T01:45:48Z","profile":{"longName":"O'Reilly Automotive, Inc.","shortName":"O'Reilly Automotive, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Parts","country":"United States","website":"https://www.oreillyauto.com","fullTimeEmployees":96820,"marketCap":72326168576,"trailingPE":27.57362,"forwardPE":24.550518,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.8090148,"pegRatio":1.71,"targetMeanPrice":106.46154,"targetHighPrice":122.0,"targetLowPrice":91.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.088,"earningsGrowth":0.134,"grossMargins":0.51786,"operatingMargins":0.21445999,"profitMargins":0.14273,"totalRevenue":18988156928,"beta":0.554,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":102.46,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":82.59,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"O'Reilly Automotive, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as a retailer and supplier of automotive aftermarket parts, tools, supplies, equipment, and accessories in the United States, Puerto Rico, Mexico, and Canada. The company offers new and remanufactured automotive hard parts and maintenance items, such as alternators, batteries, brake system components, belts, chassis parts, driveline parts, engine parts, fuel pumps, hoses, starters, temperature control, water pumps, antifreeze, appearance products, engine additives, filters, fluids, lighting products, and oil and wiper blades; and accessories, including floor mats, seat covers, and truck accessories. It also provides auto body paint and related materials, automotive tools, and professional service provider service equipment. In addition, the company offers enhanced services and programs consisting of used oil, oil filter, and battery recycling; battery, wiper, and bulb replacement; battery diagnostic testing; electrical and module testing; check engine light code extraction; loaner tool program; referrals to trusted local repair shops; drum and rotor resurfacing; custom hydraulic hoses; and professional paint shop mixing and related materials. It offers its products to do-it-yourself and professional service providers for domestic and imported automobiles, vans, and trucks. It offers its products under the BesTe","summary_zh":"O'Reilly Automotive, Inc. 及其子公司在美國、波多黎各、墨西哥和加拿大作為汽車售後零件、工具、用品、設備和配件的零售商和供應商運營。公司提供全新和再製造的汽車硬體和維修用品，如交流發電機、電池、煞車系統部件、皮帶、底盤部件、傳動系統部件、引擎部件、燃油泵、軟管、起動機、溫控器、水泵、防凍液、外觀產品、引擎添加劑、過濾器、液體、照明產品、機油和雨刷片；以及它還提供汽車車身油漆及相關材料、汽車工具以及專業服務提供者服務設備。此外，該公司還提供增強的服務和計劃，包括廢油、油過濾器和電池回收；更換電池、雨刮器和燈泡；電池診斷測試；電氣和模組測試；檢查發動機燈代碼提取；借用工具程序；推薦到值得信賴的當地維修店；滾筒和轉子表面重修；定製液壓軟管；以及專業油漆車間混合及相關材料。它為國產和進口汽車、貨車和卡車的DIY和專業服務提供者提供產品。它在 BesTe 下提供其產品","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"汽車零件","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":104.94,"h":106.55,"l":104.89,"c":106.4,"v":4360900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":105.74,"h":107.08,"l":105.02,"c":106.92,"v":3533500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":106.66,"h":107.2,"l":104.65,"c":105.11,"v":4999600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":105.66,"h":108.07,"l":105.51,"c":107.82,"v":5272000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":107.43,"h":108.42,"l":107.2,"c":107.5,"v":4783100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":107.33,"h":107.9,"l":105.68,"c":106.3,"v":6955700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":106.21,"h":107.16,"l":105.38,"c":105.39,"v":5495900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":105.45,"h":106.08,"l":103.74,"c":104.55,"v":6557600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":104.25,"h":105.39,"l":103.48,"c":103.69,"v":6215000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":104.06,"h":104.37,"l":103.23,"c":103.93,"v":10047600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":103.34,"h":104.61,"l":103.18,"c":103.45,"v":4971000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":102.87,"h":104.13,"l":100.95,"c":103.73,"v":5495200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":103.66,"h":104.11,"l":102.73,"c":103.47,"v":4982200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":104.03,"h":105.12,"l":103.39,"c":104.58,"v":4415700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":105.04,"h":106.3,"l":104.3,"c":106.1,"v":3454300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":106.24,"h":107.71,"l":105.88,"c":107.55,"v":4527200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":107.5,"h":108.72,"l":107.5,"c":107.81,"v":5027500},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":107.64,"h